A hosted quote's first-block plus attaches any non-list block at column zero

```
> - > +
# h
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <blockquote>
        <h1 id="h">h</h1>
      </blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
> - > +
| c |
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <blockquote>
        <table>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>c</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
> - a
> - > +
# h
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>a</li>
    <li>
      <blockquote>
        <h1 id="h">h</h1>
      </blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```
